@TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5030
@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt

### Dashboard summary for the current month in the business timezone
GET {{TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Dashboard summary for a custom date range
GET {{TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/summary?fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
